      ],
      "text": "Table 1.\t Pooled estimates of risk for active TB among household contacts stratified by age and baseline",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38609313964844,
        67.51299285888672,
        340.3020324707031,
        80.4429931640625
      ],
      "text": "LTBI status as compared with the general population",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.7615051269531,
        237.75367736816406,
        275.2655029296875
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        278.5841064453125,
        526.61328125,
        291.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted the significantly higher risk of infants and young children < 5 years for developing active",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.5841064453125,
        526.6570434570312,
        305.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "TB. Furthermore, the disease can develop rapidly in young children, and they are at greatest risk for severe",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.5841064453125,
        526.6202392578125,
        319.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "and disseminated disease, associated with high morbidity and mortality. Therefore, the GDG strongly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.5841064453125,
        526.6482543945312,
        333.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "recommended preventive treatment for child household contacts aged < 5 years, regardless of the background",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.5841064453125,
        526.6251831054688,
        347.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "epidemiology of TB, but only after active TB disease has been ruled out. Preventive treatment could also be",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.5841064453125,
        526.6591186523438,
        361.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "considered conditionally for household contacts in other age groups, according to clinical judgement on the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.5841064453125,
        526.6636352539062,
        375.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "balance between harm and benefit for individuals and the national and local epidemiology of TB, with special",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.5841064453125,
        526.6862182617188,
        389.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "consideration of on-going transmission of TB. The GDG also noted that the availability of resources and the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.5841064453125,
        526.6344604492188,
        403.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "capacity of the health infrastructure to assess the intensity and the risk of exposure and development of active",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.5841064453125,
        526.7250366210938,
        417.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "TB, to weigh harm and benefit and to exclude active TB disease before initiation of treatment are important",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.5841064453125,
        321.3540954589844,
        431.38409423828125
      ],
      "text": "considerations in the conditionality of the recommendation.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.54290771484375,
        292.636962890625,
        463.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "2.4\t Other HIV-negative at-risk groups",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        481.968994140625,
        497.1960754394531,
        494.2430114746094
      ],
      "text": "Patients initiating anti-TNF treatment, patients receiving dialysis, patients preparing for an organ or",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        493.9674987792969,
        500.0585021972656,
        506.24151611328125
      ],
      "text": "haematological transplant and patients with silicosis should be systematically tested and treated for",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        505.96600341796875,
        438.5534362792969,
        518.239990234375
      ],
      "text": "LTBI.  (Strong recommendation, low–very low-quality evidence. Updated recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        523.6360473632812,
        501.5157775878906,
        535.9100341796875
      ],
      "text": "In countries with a low TB incidence, systematic testing for and treatment of LTBI may be considered",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        535.634521484375,
        488.46356201171875,
        547.9085083007812
      ],
      "text": "for prisoners, health workers, immigrants from countries with a high TB burden, homeless people",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        547.6329956054688,
        494.42022705078125,
        559.906982421875
      ],
      "text": "and people who use illicit drugs.  (Conditional recommendation, low–very low-quality evidence. Existing",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        559.6315307617188,
        164.4452667236328,
        571.905517578125
      ],
      "text": "recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        577.301513671875,
        474.94805908203125,
        589.5755004882812
      ],
      "text": "Systematic testing for LTBI is not recommended for people with diabetes, people with harmful",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        589.300048828125,
        499.05609130859375,
        601.5740356445312
      ],
      "text": "alcohol use, tobacco smokers and underweight people unless they are already included in the above",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        601.2985229492188,
        491.9870910644531,
        613.572509765625
      ],
      "text": "recommendations.  (Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence. Existing recommendation)",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03570556640625,
        618.9306030273438,
        498.2733459472656,
        631.2425537109375
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  People should be tested and treated for LTBI with strict adherence to human rights and the strongest",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03570556640625,
        630.967041015625,
        482.775146484375,
        643.2410278320312
      ],
      "text": "ethical considerations. For example, positive test results or treatment for LTBI should not affect a person’s",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03570556640625,
        642.9655151367188,
        304.6604919433594,
        655.239501953125
      ],
      "text": "immigration status or delay the possibility of immigrating.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        660.1236572265625,
        498.8916931152344,
        671.6436157226562
      ],
      "text": "Source of existing recommendations: Guidelines on the management of latent tuberculosis infection. Geneva:",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        671.1216430664062,
        496.68280029296875,
        682.6416015625
      ],
      "text": "World Health Organization; 2015 (http://apps.who.int/medicinedocs/documents/s21682en/s21682en.pdf).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.3047485351562,
        174.2017364501953,
        727.8087158203125
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.12744140625,
        526.6492309570312,
        743.9274291992188
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considered the three systematic reviews that were conducted for the previous LTBI guidelines to",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.12744140625,
        526.63916015625,
        757.9274291992188
      ],
      "text": "determine which of the 24 defined at-risk population groups should be priorities for LTBI testing and treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.12744140625,
        526.7222290039062,
        771.9274291992188
      ],
      "text": "for this update  . Evidence of an increased prevalence of LTBI, an increased risk of progression from LTBI  (9, 10)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.832298278808594,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.688297271728516,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "12",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
